   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "The same marking.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "over 7's shoulder toward cube",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_02",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Our histories were not always kept apart.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "matching inserts of related markings",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_03",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Is this one like mine?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_04",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "This holds our record. Yours belongs to the Moon.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_05",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Then why did it show me something that felt like a memory?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "brief eye close-up",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_06",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Let us see what ours shows you.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_07",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "attendant",
   "label": "Attendant",
   "text": "The lower channel has collapsed.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Attendant",
   "cue": "falling dust insert",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_08",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Move everyone off that terrace.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_09",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "What’s causing it?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_10",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Someone beneath the gardens. He is forcing the burrowing creatures through our foundations.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_11",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Why?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_12",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "He wants us to surrender the temple.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_13",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "We cannot keep repairing the ground while he tears it away.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_14",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Then I’ll find him.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_15",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "The creatures are being driven. Please remember that.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C04_16",
   "scene": "VEN_C04",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "I will.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C05_01",
   "scene": "VEN_C05",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "They aren’t attacking the people.",
   "delivery": "in-gameplay",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C05_02",
   "scene": "VEN_C05",
   "speaker": "cat",
   "label": "Panther",
   "text": "What are they doing?",
   "delivery": "telepathic",
   "voice": "Cat",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C05_03",
   "scene": "VEN_C05",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Following something. Every time that sound starts, they move.",
   "delivery": "in-gameplay",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C05_04",
   "scene": "VEN_C05",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "There.",
   "delivery": "in-gameplay",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C05_05",
   "scene": "VEN_C05",
   "speaker": "cat",
   "label": "Panther",
   "text": "Then find what’s calling them.",
   "delivery": "telepathic",
   "voice": "Cat",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C06_01",
   "scene": "VEN_C06",
   "speaker": "wormmaster",
   "label": "Wormmaster",
   "text": "They sent someone down at last.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Wormmaster",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C06_02",
   "scene": "VEN_C06",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "You’re bringing their gardens down.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C06_03",
   "scene": "VEN_C06",
   "speaker": "wormmaster",
   "label": "Wormmaster",
   "text": "They can leave.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Wormmaster",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C06_04",
   "scene": "VEN_C06",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "It’s their home.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C06_05",
   "scene": "VEN_C06",
   "speaker": "wormmaster",
   "label": "Wormmaster",
   "text": "Then they should have been more willing to negotiate.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Wormmaster",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C06_06",
   "scene": "VEN_C06",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Turn it off.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C06_07",
   "scene": "VEN_C06",
   "speaker": "wormmaster",
   "label": "Wormmaster",
   "text": "Come and do it yourself.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Wormmaster",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C07_01",
   "scene": "VEN_C07",
   "speaker": "wormmaster",
   "label": "Wormmaster",
   "text": "You don’t know what you’re interfering with.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Wormmaster",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C07_02",
   "scene": "VEN_C07",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "I know what was standing above it.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C08_01",
   "scene": "VEN_C08",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "The ground is quiet.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C08_02",
   "scene": "VEN_C08",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "It will need repairs.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C08_03",
   "scene": "VEN_C08",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Repairs we can make.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C08_04",
   "scene": "VEN_C08",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "You came with a question.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C09_01",
   "scene": "VEN_C09",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "That tree… it was barely up to my knee.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C09_02",
   "scene": "VEN_C09",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "You saw the first planting.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C09_03",
   "scene": "VEN_C09",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Someone was holding a seed. They were waiting for me to take it.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C09_04",
   "scene": "VEN_C09",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "The planting is in our record. That moment is not.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C09_05",
   "scene": "VEN_C09",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "I think I knew them.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C10_01",
   "scene": "VEN_C10",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Take this record with you.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C10_02",
   "scene": "VEN_C10",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "You still have it here?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C10_03",
   "scene": "VEN_C10",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Yes.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C10_04",
   "scene": "VEN_C10",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Then why give me another?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C10_05",
   "scene": "VEN_C10",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "You saw how close he came.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C10_06",
   "scene": "VEN_C10",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "If this place were lost, I would want someone to know we had been here.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_01",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "These came from different worlds. Were your temples connected?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_02",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Yes. We exchanged records. Each temple kept something the others could not.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_03",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Do you know where any of the others are?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_04",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Two locations survive in our records. Mars—and Europa.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_05",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "What will I find on Mars?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_06",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "A temple among the divided kingdoms. It stood before their borders were drawn.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_07",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "And now it’s on someone’s side of a border.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": "a quiet sigh"
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_08",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Almost certainly.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": "gently"
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_09",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "And this one?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_10",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Beneath Europa’s ice. The Cetaceans were its keepers.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_11",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Were?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_12",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "We have not heard from either temple in a long time.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_13",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "So we don’t know whether they’re still there.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_14",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "No. Only where to begin looking.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_15",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Can you send these to my ship?",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_16",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Of course.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_17",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "cat",
   "label": "Panther",
   "text": "Received. Two destinations.",
   "delivery": "telepathic",
   "voice": "Cat",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_18",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "We’ll look at them together when I get back.",
   "delivery": "telepathic",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_19",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Thank you. For trusting me with this.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": "warmly"
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C12_20",
   "scene": "VEN_C12",
   "speaker": "guardian",
   "label": "Guardian",
   "text": "Thank you for giving us the chance to keep it.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Guardian",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C11_01",
   "scene": "VEN_C11",
   "speaker": "cat",
   "label": "Panther",
   "text": "Did they know what it was?",
   "delivery": "telepathic",
   "voice": "Cat",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C11_02",
   "scene": "VEN_C11",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "The Moon’s record. Venus has its own.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C11_03",
   "scene": "VEN_C11",
   "speaker": "cat",
   "label": "Panther",
   "text": "And the people you saw?",
   "delivery": "telepathic",
   "voice": "Cat",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C11_04",
   "scene": "VEN_C11",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "They’re less certain about that.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C11_05",
   "scene": "VEN_C11",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "There was something else. Something the guardian said wasn’t in their record.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C11_06",
   "scene": "VEN_C11",
   "speaker": "cat",
   "label": "Panther",
   "text": "What did you see?",
   "delivery": "telepathic",
   "voice": "Cat",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C11_07",
   "scene": "VEN_C11",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Someone giving me a seed.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C11_08",
   "scene": "VEN_C11",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "I wish I could remember their face.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C11_09",
   "scene": "VEN_C11",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "There are other temples.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C11_10",
   "scene": "VEN_C11",
   "speaker": "cat",
   "label": "Panther",
   "text": "Then we have somewhere else to ask.",
   "delivery": "telepathic",
   "voice": "Cat",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C13_01",
   "scene": "VEN_C13",
   "speaker": "cat",
   "label": "Panther",
   "text": "The guardian’s locations. Mars and Europa.",
   "delivery": "telepathic",
   "voice": "Cat",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C13_02",
   "scene": "VEN_C13",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "A temple between divided kingdoms.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C13_03",
   "scene": "VEN_C13",
   "speaker": "cat",
   "label": "Panther",
   "text": "Convenient. Everyone can argue over it without travelling far.",
   "delivery": "telepathic",
   "voice": "Cat",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": "dryly"
  },
  {
   "id": "VEN_C13_04",
   "scene": "VEN_C13",
   "speaker": "seven",
   "label": "7",
   "text": "Perhaps we’ll arrive on a quiet day.",
   "delivery": "spoken",
   "voice": "Seven",
   "cue": "",
   "direction": "a small chuckle"
  },
  {
